#, menu
msgid "GBA Virtual Console games are not supported."
msgstr "Game GBA Virtual Console tidak didukung."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:549
#, menu
msgid "The game's system mode could not be found."
msgstr "Mode sistem game tidak ditemukan."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:550
#, menu
msgid "The game needs 3DS system files Azahar does not have."
msgstr "Game memerlukan file sistem 3DS yang tidak dimiliki Azahar."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:552
#, menu
msgid "The game's patches could not be applied."
msgstr "Patch game tidak bisa diterapkan."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:553
#, menu
msgid "Azahar's renderer or CPU did not start."
msgstr "Perender atau CPU Azahar tidak berjalan."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:555
#, menu
msgid "The Artic Base server did not answer: check the 3DS's address, that Artic Base runs on it, and that the 3DS and the PS5 are on the same network."
msgstr "Server Artic Base tidak menjawab: periksa alamat 3DS, bahwa Artic Base berjalan di sana, dan bahwa 3DS dan PS5 ada di jaringan yang sama."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:623
#, menu
msgid "The game is busy: try again"
msgstr "Game sedang sibuk: coba lagi"

#. the PS5's notification as an Artic Base game ends because the 3DS stopped answering
#: port/azahar/core.cpp:642
#, menu
msgid "The 3DS stopped answering: the Artic Base game has stopped."
msgstr "3DS berhenti menjawab: game Artic Base berhenti."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:644
#, menu
msgid "The 3DS game stopped: {0}"
msgstr "Game 3DS berhenti: {0}"

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:693
#, menu
msgid "A CIA file is installed, not played: install it from Settings > Game files, then start the game."
msgstr "File CIA dipasang, bukan dimainkan: pasang dari Pengaturan > File game, lalu mulai game-nya."

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:717
#, menu
msgid "Azahar did not start: {0}"
msgstr "Azahar tidak berjalan: {0}"

#: port/azahar/core.cpp:726
#, menu
msgid "Artic Setup did not finish: the Artic Setup Tool on the 3DS says why. If it says nothing, check the 3DS's address, and that the 3DS and the PS5 are on the same network."
msgstr "Artic Setup tidak selesai: Artic Setup Tool di 3DS menunjukkan sebabnya. Jika tidak menunjukkan apa pun, periksa alamat 3DS, dan bahwa 3DS dan PS5 ada di jaringan yang sama."

#. why an Artic Base game did not start, when the 3DS had answered; Y is the 3DS's button
#: port/azahar/core.cpp:732
#, menu
msgid "The 3DS answered, then Artic Base stopped before the game started. On the 3DS, press Y in the Artic Base app to restart its server, then connect again. If it stops again, Settings > Diagnostics > Copy logs to USB copies Azahar's log, which says what failed."
msgstr "3DS sempat menjawab, lalu Artic Base berhenti sebelum game dimulai. Di 3DS, tekan Y di aplikasi Artic Base untuk memulai ulang servernya, lalu sambungkan lagi. Jika berhenti lagi, Pengaturan > Diagnostik > Salin log ke USB menyalin log Azahar, yang menunjukkan apa yang gagal."

#. the PS5's notification as a 3DS game starts
#: port/azahar/core.cpp:800
#, menu
msgid "Touchpad click + Options: the in-game menu. A touchpad click alone: the bottom screen"
msgstr "Klik panel sentuh + OPTIONS: menu dalam game. Klik panel sentuh saja: layar bawah"

